  "en": [
   "Come, come close to me,",
   "let me adorn you—",
   "on your hands, bangles of lotus-stem,",
   "on your ears, earrings of champa,",
   "on your head, a parting-chain of bel flowers,",
   "in your braided hair, bakul blossoms.",
   "O brother, come and see,",
   "how many flowers I have gathered!"
