 "9704": {
  "en": [
   "Tomorrow morning we shall rise,",
   "we shall go to the river's bank—",
   "we shall shape a Shiva and worship him,",
   "we shall bring flowers we have plucked.",
   "At break of dawn we shall string garlands,",
   "we shall sway on the swing.",
   "Playing the flute we shall sing songs",
   "beneath the bakul tree.",
   "No, brother, tomorrow morning to Mother",
   "I shall take you by the hand—",
   "Mother has said that in a sage's garb",
   "she will dress you up.",
   "Evening has come on, brother,",
   "now I go back—",
   "my blind father is alone",
   "in the dark hut."
  ],
