 "9705": {
  "en": [
   "Before us flows the river,",
   "two stars have blossomed in the sky,",
   "the breeze blows, plundering fragrance.",
   "From the lips of evening",
   "a faint smile falls, breaking away.",
   "The day begs its leave,",
   "the Sarayu sings its lament,",
   "at the crimson feet of dusk",
   "weeping, weeping, it falls prostrate!",
   "Come, all of you, come, friend,",
   "let us sit here awhile.",
   "Gazing toward the sky",
   "let us watch the play of the clouds!",
   "Upon our eyes the stars",
   "will blossom one by one."
  ],
