 "9707": {
  "en": [
   "Behold, O companion,",
   "darkening the forest,",
   "look, there comes the night.",
   "Covering the horizon,",
   "dark banks of cloud float layer upon layer.",
   "Come, friend, while there is time,",
   "madhabi, malati, bel—",
   "let us make them bloom in heaps and light up the forest.",
   "Look there, the lotus brims upon the lake.",
   "The half-opened bud-faces smile ever so softly.",
   "The sage's son will come to gather flowers;",
   "for him we shall keep them blooming with care.",
   "May the flowers bloom on the low, low branches,",
   "so his little hands, reaching out, may find them near!"
  ],
