 "9711": {
  "en": [
   "Thick clouds have covered the sky, gathering dense,",
   "the ten directions grown dim,",
   "the forest stunned still,",
   "all creation in anguish—",
   "what will happen, who knows—",
   "a fearsome night,",
   "the maidens of the quarters dazed with fear.",
   "Flash upon flash, suddenly lighting the horizons,",
   "startled, frenzied, the lightning darted forth,",
   "all creation trembling, ablaze in an instant.",
   "Deep darkness shrouds sky and earth,",
   "to the deep rumbling roar of the clouds",
   "the hushed dark lies sleeping—",
   "suddenly a furious gale woke and rose,",
   "crashing, crackling thunder!"
