 "9713": {
  "en": [
   "Come, dear friend, all together!",
   "The rain streams pouring down,",
   "a soft, soft, deep, deep rumbling—",
   "on this rainy day,",
   "holding hand in hand,",
   "we shall sing, swinging on the vine-swing!",
   "With care we shall make countless ketaki and kadamba bloom.",
   "We shall daub colour on flower after flower.",
   "We shall give fresh water to drink to the thirsting trees and vines—",
   "we shall lift the creepers and bind them to the trees.",
   "We shall deck the forest, string beads of pearl",
   "on its leaf-green raiment.",
   "We shall dance, friend, all of us, in the festival of new clouds,",
   "at the foot of the blossoming bakul tree!"
