 "9715": {
  "en": [
   "You heeded no forbidding — still you went,",
   "who knows what may happen!",
   "Why does such foreboding stir in my heart,",
   "why, again and again, does my heart break out weeping!",
   "Heed my word, oh heed it — let the water-fetching be,",
   "go home, go, run!",
   "O maidens of the quarters, keep him with care",
   "in the sheltering shade of fearless love!",
   "O night, hold him to your breast,",
   "steal away his fear, keep this child safe!",
   "He is but a child in mind, and the forest is so deep—",
   "he is alone and helpless!"
