 "9716": {
  "en": [
   "Through the forests, all together — onward, ho! Onward, ho!",
   "Come running — who will come to the hunt, come along!",
   "Such a night is slipping away!",
   "With bow, arrow and spear in hand,",
   "come, come, come, come along!",
   "Sound the horn again and again—",
   "the forest will tremble at the sound,",
   "the sky will split apart,",
   "beasts and birds will all be startled,",
   "they will flee from grove to grove—",
   "circling on every side, we will follow close behind—",
   "Ho! Ho! Ho! Ho!"
  ],
  "align": [
   [
    [
     "বনে",
