 "9719": {
  "en": [
   "Come along, come, brothers,",
   "let us hurry on ahead.",
   "Search with all your might — this wood, that wood.",
   "Come, a few of us will go that way.",
   "No, no, brother, no use,",
   "there is nothing there — nothing at all—",
   "perhaps in that thicket we may find something.",
   "A boar! A boar!",
   "Hey, wait, wait—",
   "so much haste and the quarry will slip away.",
   "Come softly, softly come",
   "beneath the peepul tree—",
   "now hold yourselves ready, all of you—",
   "careful, take aim — careful, loose the arrow—",
   "there it goes, it goes — there, there, it flees, it flees—",
   "come on, come on—",
