 "9721": {
  "en": [
   "Ah, I am saved now!",
   "Yours truly goes that way no more.",
   "In the confusion, on the sly, how neatly I slipped away.",
   "Good heavens! At the sight of that boar's row of teeth",
   "my jaws locked tight in a faint,",
   "the stick dropped from my hand,",
   "who knows when.",
   "Every hair stood on end at my neck,",
   "my two eyes blazed like torches,",
   "and when, head down in stubborn fury, it charged—",
   "when it came at me—",
   "my eyes could not find the road,",
   "my arms and legs shrank into my belly,",
   "my puffed-up paunch collapsed flat",
   "with terror then."
