 "9723": {
  "en": [
   "Who has come, this deep dark night,",
   "to destroy the peace of our beloved grove?",
   "Maddened elephants trample the lotus beds,",
   "churning the clear lake;",
   "why do they slay the sleeping birds,",
   "aiming sharp arrows thick and fast!",
   "Startled with terror, stag and doe",
   "flee on stumbling feet!",
   "On stumbling feet they flee through the grove,",
   "gazing with piteous eyes.",
   "The lake is in anguish; crane and his mate,",
   "hiding in the reeds, are weeping.",
   "Darkness fills the quarters, fearsome the night,",
   "peril spreading its dense shadow.",
   "Who knows what will happen tonight, this night;",
   "the heart rises trembling with terror!"
