 "9724": {
  "en": [
   "I know not where I have come — this is deep forest.",
   "Where has that elephant calf gone, where has it hidden!",
   "The wood is tangled enough, and the dark is dense besides!",
   "Let it go — how far can it go, how far—",
   "I will follow close behind—",
   "No, no, no, no — what is that I hear!",
   "There, on the Sarayu's bank, it is drinking water—",
   "I hear the sound there — now then, I loose my arrow!"
