 "9725": {
  "en": [
   "What have I done, alas!",
   "This is no elephant calf — it is a sage's son!",
   "By the cruel, piercing arrow his body is drenched in blood;",
   "whose darling child lies sprawled in the dust!",
   "In what evil hour, I know not, did I take up the arrow;",
   "in what great sin have I slain a life, and whose!",
   "Gods, with the water of immortality give back the lost life;",
   "carry the mother's child back to his mother's lap!"
